Ship time for Royal Caribbean and Celebrity cruises.

Search for a ship by name and add it to your world clock. A ship's clock is set by the crew and shifts mid-cruise, so it isn't something a map can work out — GeoTime asks the ship.

Board one and connect to wifi, and it's recognised automatically, with a Ship Time reading beside your local and device time. It stays on your list when you go ashore, so you still know when to be back.
